        "client_msg_id": "fecf0f67-5ac7-48ed-bbfa-ccd0719495ce",
        "text": "I also like Unix pipes.  But I don\u2019t like _requiring_ processes, IPC and serialization.  I do like having the option of these things.\n\nSo I just generalize to objects and pass those between filters that \u2026 are also objects.\n\nThis is a generalization, so if you want to run filters as processes and exchange data via serialized byte streams, that is available as a special case.\n\nBut my experience is that it is rarely necessary.\n\n<https://dl.acm.org/doi/10.1145/3359619.3359748>\n\n<https://dl.acm.org/doi/10.1145/3689492.3690052>",
        "team": "T5TCAFTA9",
        "thread_ts": "1731382560.737349",
        "parent_user_id": "UGWUJUZHT",
